      "raw": "<p>Got my \"Mint\" with the heroes at 11/7/10/6.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I was getting set up for a longer game (Chrono-Ranger and La Comodora in particular) but I think after the second round I realized this was going to be a much more damaging and fast game.&nbsp; After that the heroes just switched to \"all damage all the time\" mode and knocked Citizen Dawn out before the end of round 4.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every hero was pretty much a heavy-hitter this game.&nbsp; La Comodora might have earned MVP status with \"Rudder in the Timestream\" to move citizens out of Dawn's trash so that \"Return With the Dawn\" couldn't bring them back out again.&nbsp; I originally got La Comodora set up this way to make sure Dawn wouldn't flip.&nbsp; In hindsight I realize it was cute that I thought this game would last long enough to have to worry about that.&nbsp; I'm not sure if 5 citizens ever got into play this game.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\"Insula Primalis\" was NOT the heroes' friend this game.&nbsp; These heroes will be glad when they can leave that land.</p>",
