      "created_at": "2020-02-05T04:26:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint on La Comodora's third turn, final HP 10 - 12 - 9 - 7.</p>\n<p>Popped Assault round 1, got By Any Means out, and pretty much focus-fired Dawn from there. With nemesis bonus, By Any Means, Bloody Knuckles, Dual Crowbars, and Obsidian Field available, Dawn melted down. Got 18&nbsp;damage off La Comodora's third play phase alone; the cannons got to hold their fire.</p>",
